# Ubuntu 26.04 (resolute) packages carried by the hw-rpi5 extension: the
# board's userspace for Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, audio, I2C, GPIO and the camera,
# and `wg` for the overlay's interface manager (furcate-wg).
# The base image installs the same list (mkosi.conf, mkosi.conf.d/10-rpi5.conf);
# this extension brings it to a base that predates it, without a reinstall.
iwd
wireless-regdb
bluez
alsa-utils
i2c-tools
gpiod
wireguard-tools
